13. Recommended Workflow for Your Hardware
```text
1. Enable RDMA in Recovery on both Macs with rdma_ctl enable.
2. Verify ibv_devices shows rdma_en*.
3. Install Exo app first.
4. Confirm both Macs appear in the Exo dashboard.
5. Confirm JACCL/RDMA/tensor placement exists.
6. Test with Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct-4bit.
7. Benchmark ring vs jaccl.
8. Move to Qwen3-235B-A22B-8bit or similar large MLX model.
9. Use llama.cpp RPC only when you specifically need GGUF.
```
